dent :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291753}] :question/id #uuid "1cdb365a-568a-54ff-a0ff-388e4c99f9fd" :question/math-academy-id "q-275539" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\text{v}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =1\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-9\\,|=9\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299844 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73700a2b-b121-5954-9be4-09e3cf8c2a5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298052}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298052} :answer-field/id #uuid "f31ff876-fad2-5cde-a7f5-e10303d7363a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299453}] :question/id #uuid "362d0901-58c5-537a-b4a8-7e15773992b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-320392" :question/problem "![](images/68/6881c7b52de83103dcfc483ec25455781a4d399653e2369d28f6924327f8ee56.png)\n\nDetermine the area $A$ of the parallelogram in the figure.\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨-3,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨1,3⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot 3-1\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-9-2 \\\\  & =-11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-11|=11\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299845 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b56b387-754b-5cf9-8829-0fe285e89c96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297862}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297862} :answer-field/id #uuid "5159ce6f-4aaf-5edd-ac57-35a7fc9bcffc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298914}] :question/id #uuid "2106b5f7-d155-5686-8911-c293b62f546c" :question/math-academy-id "q-320394" :question/problem "![](images/f6/f63cf622acc15681e3815118bbd2a187ea6039a548d4be1773634c0dc450c343.png)\n\nDetermine the area $A$ of the parallelogram in the figure.\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨4,-1⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨-2,-3⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}4 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-3)-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-12-2 \\\\  & =-14\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-14|=14\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299846 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b23c197f-4fe3-5160-8515-6886564259fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298328}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298328} :answer-field/id #uuid "29e551ff-e04e-58bb-bb43-1994a42ad05f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298781}] :question/id #uuid "0ae47b66-7d53-5c4c-a6bb-e60ff971339c" :question/math-academy-id "q-320401" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\text{v}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}-2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot 4-5\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =-8-15 \\\\  & =-23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-23\\,|=23\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299847 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cc979caa-0729-52db-b9ad-f037fabe9650" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298440}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298440} :answer-field/id #uuid "7d0e666f-0f33-50fa-9b3a-68050ea5366f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299057}] :question/id #uuid "b877ff9e-20e8-50e1-8344-e018774f6173" :question/math-academy-id "q-320402" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\text{v}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =15-2 \\\\  & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,13\\,|=13\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299848 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e43811bc-26a3-5920-9a63-18bb7725c3c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "33" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298533}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "33" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298533} :answer-field/id #uuid "a611f036-0785-5438-b6af-2ed6eec3d8ba" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299195}] :question/id #uuid "586460f4-83f8-52e0-990d-cdd1c6e95132" :question/math-academy-id "q-320404" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\text{v}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}-1 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot (-2)-5\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =2-35 \\\\  & =-33\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-33\\,|=33\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299849 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3f964d77-5097-5d81-aafa-05414b56fb08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297803}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297803} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f4f3b80-c19e-56ca-9011-75fd1a7f231d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299165}] :question/id #uuid "3e9f3e3d-c238-5325-aee8-71b571be0f5d" :question/math-academy-id "q-320412" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨2,7⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨-3,1⟩.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =2\\cdot 1-(-3)\\cdot 7 \\\\  & =2-(-21) \\\\  & =23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,23\\,|=23\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299850 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d9058e27-9604-5ce6-b952-b3e5d2273a08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298483}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298483} :answer-field/id #uuid "ba8883a1-1995-5b39-99f7-87361a36a0f5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299269}] :question/id #uuid "7553ad76-d7b1-5eca-9463-9df9742eb383" :question/math-academy-id "q-320413" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨-4,-1⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨6,2⟩.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =(-4)\\cdot 2-6\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-8-(-6) \\\\  & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-2\\,|=2\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299851 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cd440cb0-4f36-544e-b800-2b632f84913a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "26" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298446}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "26" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298446} :answer-field/id #uuid "a4386ef2-d375-5d83-9422-3a383082baa8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299188}] :question/id #uuid "216d9367-5418-5e10-afd0-533eb5320c38" :question/math-academy-id "q-320414" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=⟨5,-3⟩$ and $\\text{v}=⟨-2,-4⟩.$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =\\begin{vmatrix}5 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =5\\cdot (-4)-(-2)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-20-6 \\\\  & =-26\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,-26\\,|=26\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186383438 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d0f71e4c-99fc-528e-ba79-3df352bb024e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383440} {:answer/id #uuid "d7abfc77-d448-5303-8b54-d97fd1a2d5c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383441} {:answer/id #uuid "92fe502e-732c-51c0-9b3d-22c728268f2e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186383442} {:answer/id #uuid "c1245cab-5466-55cf-b4e7-9c6b03ea